<BaseLayout title="SEO Services | Web Grouth" description="Practical SEO strategy, content, and authority building for brands that want sustainable search growth."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container reveal"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / SEO Services</div><span class="eyebrow">Search, with substance</span><h1>SEO that connects the dots.</h1><p class="lead">We turn technical clarity, useful content, and credible authority into a search strategy your team can actually use.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="grid-4">{services.map(([title,text])=><div class="card reveal"><span class="icon">↗</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div>)}</div></div></section><section class="section section-soft"><div class="container feature-band"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span><h2>No magic button. Better inputs.</h2></div><ul class="check-list"><li><span><strong>Start with the business</strong><br /><small>Search work should support a real offer and a real audience.</small></span></li><li><span><strong>Build in layers</strong><br /><small>Technical foundations, content, and authority reinforce each other.</small></span></li><li><span><strong>Keep learning</strong><br /><small>Use evidence to refine what deserves more attention next.</small></span></li></ul></div></section><section class="container"><div class="cta-band"><div><span class="eyebrow">A clearer next step</span><h2>Let’s turn your search backlog into a direction.</h2></div><a class="button button-quiet" href="/contact">Start a project <span>↗</span></a></div></section></BaseLayout>